Package: GridTable
Title: Render Data Frames as Pandoc Grid Tables
Version: 0.0.0.9003
Authors@R:
    person("liu.bian.shi", email = "uqejoanjennifern5YUEh@ninfan.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Render a 'data.frame', 'data.table', or 'knitr::kable' into a
    plain-text pandoc grid table drawn with ASCII box characters. The layout
    engine is CJK-width aware, so tables containing Chinese or other wide
    characters stay aligned. It supports merged cells, header and footer
    separator lines, per-column alignment, content wrapping, and automatic
    column-width and row-height growth so content always fits.
